module main

// T537 QA round 1 regression probe (findings F1 + F2): drives `compiler.opt.inline` call-graph summary inference,
// `inline_clone_callsite_in_mir`, `compiler.opt.alias` and `compiler.opt.memopt` directly on MIR lowered from
// source that reads and writes process-wide `static mut` items (`MIR_LOCAL_STATIC`).

use compiler.kernel.arena.Arena
use compiler.kernel.arena.arena_with_chunk_size
use compiler.kernel.arena.arena_destroy
use compiler.kernel.arena.arena_alloc_raw
